{"recordId":"emperor_宋真宗_284206980","name":"宋真宗","type":"emperor","dynasty":"北宋","title":"趙恆","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"宋真宗","pageId":48718,"revisionId":92043363,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-03-26T01:49:05Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%97","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92043363","wikidataId":"Q7475","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"《宋史·真宗本紀》","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/shibu/0101/00songs/007.htm","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite web","author":"","publisher":"","date":"","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"續資治通鑑","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"辽史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"庚溪诗话","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"卷第三十五","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋史·真宗本紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"涑水记闻·卷八","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:33:10.974Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:jinshi","source:mingshi","source:qingshigao"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:jinshi-e18bcbaf58f9e6ea","query":"宋真宗","count":1,"offset":2291,"excerpt":"將擇而處之。」久之，將授太子冊寶，儀注備儀仗告太廟。上曰：「朕受尊號謁謝，乃用故宋真宗故事，常朝服乘馬。皇太子乃用備禮，前後不稱，甚無謂也。」謂右丞相良弼、左丞守道曰：「此卿等不用心所致。」良弼等謝曰：「臣愚慮不及此。」上複曰：「此文臣因循故也。","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jinshi-340fcb243c3d1d0f","query":"宋真宗","count":1,"offset":561,"excerpt":"皆責降之。明年，將冊皇太子，宰臣奏當備儀仗告廟，上曰：「前朕受尊號謁謝，但令朕用宋真宗故事，朝服乘馬，於禮甚輕，今皇太子乃用備禮何耶？」丞相良弼謝，上徐曰：「此文臣因循，不加意爾。」先是，凡行幸皆役民執仗，是後詔以軍士易之。\n\n　　大定十一年，將","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-ef5829c2190713c5","query":"宋真宗","count":1,"offset":7230,"excerpt":"武明堂之享，以景帝配，孝章以光武配，唐中宗以高宗配，明皇以睿宗配，代宗以肅宗配，宋真宗乙太宗配，仁宗以真宗配，英宗以仁宗配，皆世以遞配，此主於親親也。宋錢公輔曰：「郊之祭，以始封之祖，有聖人之功者配焉。明堂之祭，以繼體之君，有聖人之德者配焉。」當","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-49ffb40db906f1df","query":"宋真宗","count":4,"offset":4238,"excerpt":"可及也，猶天之不可階而升，雖擬諸天，亦不為過。自唐尊孔子為文宣王，已用天子禮樂。宋真宗嘗欲封孔子為帝，或謂周止稱王，不當加帝號。而羅從彥之論，則謂加帝號亦可。至周敦頤則以為萬世無窮王祀孔子，邵雍則以為仲尼以萬世為王。其辨孔子不當稱王者，止吳澄一人","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-5b23a8a9a5395c60","query":"宋真宗","count":1,"offset":2585,"excerpt":"封為王。錫爵懼失上指，立奉詔擬諭旨。而又外慮公論，因言「漢明帝馬後、唐明皇王後、宋真宗劉後皆養諸妃子為子，請令皇后撫育元子，則元子即嫡子，而生母不必崇位號以上壓皇貴妃」，亦擬諭以進。同列趙誌臯、張位咸不預聞。帝竟以前諭下禮官，令即具儀。於是舉朝大","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-49dc0768aea82afa","query":"宋真宗","count":1,"offset":1266,"excerpt":"文，以師稱之。仲文則既死矣，彼不長生，而陛下何獨求之？至於仙桃天藥，怪妄尤甚。昔宋真宗得天書於乾祐山，孫奭曰：「天何言哉？豈有書也！」桃必采而後得，藥必制而後成。今無故獲此二物，是有足而行耶？曰天賜者，有手執而付之耶？此左右奸人，造為妄誕以欺陛下","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-8fd84c9b0c638a8d","query":"宋真宗","count":1,"offset":9409,"excerpt":"商隱張亞子廟詩，讀孫樵祭梓潼神君文，化書：唐開元命為左丞，通考：僖宗封為濟順王，宋真宗改號英顯，哲宗加封輔元開化文昌司祿帝君，元加號宏仁，蓋可考見雲。」禮官遂定議。\n\n歲春祭以二月初三誕日，秋祭，仲秋諏吉將事，遣大臣往。前殿供正神，後殿則祀其先世","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-ea64ebb1680040b9","query":"宋真宗","count":1,"offset":5865,"excerpt":"疑，復以輔導君德之說進。 \n\n是時國家多故，聖嗣尚虛，致祥為重國本計，略言：「昔宋真宗取宗室子養之宮中，逮仁宗既生，即遣歸邸；厥後仁宗、高宗、理宗皆踵行之。有子而遣養子歸邸者，真宗是也。無子而即以養子傳授神器者，仁宗之於英宗，高宗之於孝宗，理宗之","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":8,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:jinshi-e18bcbaf58f9e6ea","bookId":"book:jinshi","requestedTitle":"金史/卷19","title":"金史/卷19","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B719","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2432672","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B719?action=history","revisionId":2432672,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-07-05T14:40:03Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:56:08.023Z","sha256":"230cf1eba7ee97caa8d0c1e3a4924f1f45694a0309720038c4c0a60541ddfaf8","textSha256":"e1a4acf4092ca70dc937094964b287dad15e943580bc21d99388fa036ed22d06","expandedWikitextSha256":"230cf1eba7ee97caa8d0c1e3a4924f1f45694a0309720038c4c0a60541ddfaf8","characters":5271,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/jinshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.143Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/4860de6f247d9d0cb1f2.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/4860de6f247d9d0cb1f2.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:jinshi-340fcb243c3d1d0f","bookId":"book:jinshi","requestedTitle":"金史/卷42","title":"金史/卷42","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B742","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2606128","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B742?action=history","revisionId":2606128,"revisi